Z||000000||CHOWITT31||02-08-2001||03:01 PM||||Hi folks on my way to work this afternoon my TCC started to kick in and out and eventualy thru a code wich turned out to be a code 22.<BR>Now this same thing happened about a week ago but it disappeared.<BR>Anyway, has this problem ever happened to any of you folks and if so what was the fix.<BR>It looks like I will have to replace the TPS.<BR>Comments and opinions welcome.<BR>Thanks<BR>ken||||reg||5
